{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"00c51ded-cfdf-4b31-a1c1-66c7d18fcbd8","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam Germany Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-germany-track","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperteam Germany track - Crypto World’s Fair\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThis track is a local prize pool for German teams competing in Colosseum's Crypto World's Fair.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"\u003eCrypto World’s Fair brings builders from across the world’s leading blockchain ecosystems into one open competition. This side track is our way of backing the strongest German founders taking part.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project is built on Solana\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eThe Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYou must submit to the Crypto World’s Fair hackathon and mark \u003cstrong\u003e\"GERMANY\" \u003c/strong\u003eas your country\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003eofficial rules of the global hackathon\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 65, 85);\"\u003eThe judging criteria for the Superteam Germany Track will mirror that of the global hackathon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Impact:\u003c/strong\u003e does the project contribute real value through infrastructure, tooling, or a product people need?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct-Market Fit:\u003c/strong\u003e is there a clear problem, a defined user, and early signs that the solution works?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGrowth Potential:\u003c/strong\u003e can the project attract new users or deepen engagement among existing ones?\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRewards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eTotal pool: \u003cstrong\u003e$5,000\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1st place:\u003c/strong\u003e $2,000\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2nd place:\u003c/strong\u003e $1,500\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3rd place:\u003c/strong\u003e $1,000\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest first-time team:\u003c/strong\u003e $500 (your first Colosseum hackathon)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBerlin \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/buildstation\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuild Station\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e, \u003c/strong\u003ea hackathon co-working initiative, runs October 8-12 for the final stretch of the hackathon, with intensive mentorship\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColosseum submissions\u003c/strong\u003e close October 12.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDemo Dinner in Berlin, \u003c/strong\u003eOctober 15. Selected founders pitch to and dine with a group of capital allocators from across Europe in an intimate setting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eCrypto World's Fair Website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/hackathon\"\u003eSuperteam Hackathon Resources Website\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/build\"\u003eSuperteam Build\u003c/a\u003e, if you’re looking for ideas to build\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-27T21:59:59.999Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"op